message: "If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Quaternary Covering Code K_4(8,4) Upper-Bound Workbench"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Raval
    given-names: Ruturaj R
    affiliation: Independent Researcher
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4930-8981"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ruturajr-raval/quaternary-covering-code-8-4-upper-bound"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reproducible prerelease package for K_4(8,4). A verified 27-word
  quaternary length-8 code has exact covering radius 4 and improves the
  audited upper bound from 28 to 27. A retained 26-word candidate has
  exactly five radius-4 holes.
keywords:
  - covering codes
  - coding theory
  - exhaustive verification
  - Hamming space
  - construction
